sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Runtime as Agent Runtime
    participant LLM
    participant Tool as Python Tool
    User->>Runtime: Ask about a book
    Runtime->>LLM: User input + tool definitions
    LLM-->>Runtime: function_call(name, arguments, call_id)
    Note over Runtime: Parse, validate, and authorize
    Runtime->>Tool: Execute approved function
    Tool-->>Runtime: Actual result or error
    Runtime->>LLM: function_call_output(same call_id, result)
    LLM-->>Runtime: Another call or final answer
